                        "entry_id": "2ef8c82f-44e1-36cc-9c48-639e9e7a137d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In the Old Testament and Qur'an, a king of Israel famous for his wisdom; father of King Rehoboam and the son of King David."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
